on exitFrame
  [  0] pushsymb 19 ............................. <#playFile>
  [  2] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  5] getglobal 29 ............................ <effectspath>
  [  7] pushcons 0 .............................. <"crank.aif">
  [  9] joinstr ................................. <effectspath & "crank.aif">
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 3 ...................... <2, effectspath & "crank.aif">
  [ 12] extcall 20 .............................. sound playFile 2, effectspath & "crank.aif"
  [ 14] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 17] pushint8 255 ............................ <255>
  [ 20] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 23] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to 255
  [ 25] ret
end
